  "data": {
    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "Secondary Missions are extra ways to earn VP. The Attacker and the Defender each have a deck, and both decks hold the same cards.\n\n1. Each player secretly notes whether they will use [Fixed](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.fixed-secondary-missions) or [Tactical](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.tactical-secondary-missions) Secondary Missions; a Fixed player also notes their two Fixed Missions.\n2. Both players reveal their choices.\n\nIn a first game you can leave Secondary Missions out. Tournament play and other formats are covered in the official Warhammer 40,000 app.",
